[CONTROLS]
LINK 13 OPEN IF NODE T1 BELOW 5
LINK 13 CLOSED IF NODE T1 ABOVE 18 DISABLED
LINK PU2 0.5 AT TIME 6
LINK PU2 CLOSED AT CLOCKTIME 10:30 PM
LINK V1 35 AT TIME 2:30
LINK 15 1.0 AT TIME 1 HOURS
LINK 11 CLOSED AT TIME 3             ; a check valve: refused

[RULES]
RULE one
IF TANK T1 LEVEL BELOW 6
AND SYSTEM CLOCKTIME >= 8:00 AM
OR LINK PU1 FLOW > 100
THEN PUMP PU1 STATUS IS OPEN
AND VALVE V1 SETTING IS 45
ELSE PUMP PU1 STATUS IS CLOSED
PRIORITY 2
RULE two
IF NODE J2 PRESSURE < 30
THEN PIPE 13 STATUS IS 1
AND PIPE 15 STATUS IS 0
DISABLED
RULE three
IF SYSTEM DEMAND > 50
THEN PUMP PU3 SETTING IS 0.8
RULE four
IF JUNCTION J9 HEAD > 5                ; unknown node: this rule is dropped and the rest skipped
THEN PUMP PU1 STATUS IS OPEN
RULE five
IF TANK T2 FILLTIME > 2
THEN PIPE 14 STATUS IS CLOSED

